    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Opening the app and pressing play", "items": ["1-2 DNS picks a healthy region; TLS passes DDoS and WAF filtering to Zuul", "2-3 Zuul authenticates the device and checks plan, profile and region rights", "4-5 DGS composes the view by calling domain services over gRPC with a time budget", "6-7 Reads go to EVCache first, then Cassandra; the home page returns", "8 On Play, the device gets a license and OCA URLs, then streams from the nearest OCA", "9-10 Play events and telemetry flow asynchronously; nobody waits"] },
